==Description==
This pet is exclusive and is the only one available to {{ClassTooltip|Chronomancer}} during the [[Quasi-Realms#In Over Your Head|In Over Your Head Quasi-Realm]].

It increases [[Compressed Time]] per tick, and periodically yields Mana.

Cannot gain experience.

==Pet Ability==

Increases [[Compressed Time]] per tick by

<math>CT = \left(1 + \frac{\log_{10}(P)}{3}\right)\cdot\left(1 + \frac{L-1}{10}\right).</math>

Yields <math>A</math> mana per activation, with

<math> A = 100 \cdot M \cdot P^2 \cdot \left(1 + \frac{(L - 1) ^ 4}{ 100}\right),</math>

where
* <math>CT = \text{Increase to Compressed Time gain per tick},</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power},</math> 
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level},</math>
* <math>A = \text{Mana granted per pet ability activation},</math>
* <math>M = \text{Mana per second}.</math>

The ability activates once per second. Can be reduced by {{ItemTooltip|Whiplash}},{{ItemTooltip|Collar Of Obedience}} and empathy perks.

==Experience Gain==
This pet, unlike others, ''cannot'' earn experience.

It gains 1 level for every cast of {{SpellTooltip|Time Fork}} while {{SpellTooltip|Generate Paradox}} is active.

